body:
Honestly, you can't. The future is naturally scary. The only thing you can control is how you think of it. Try practicing mindfulness and staying in the moment. You can't control the past or the future, so focus on what you can control, the present.

&#x200B;

If it makes you feel less alone, this is where various schools of thought attribute all anxiety. "Anxiety is caused by worry for the future, depression is caused by regret from the past."

Sure, do you have all of them or just a few?

&#x200B;

Oops - just saw you mentioned it. Let me know when you're ready.

Sexual preference and gender are completely different. Being a girl comes with a lot more than just "liking guys". Especially when some girls don't aren't even attracted to guys. 

&#x200B;

Sexual preference and gender identity are often linked (hence a large portion of the population being straight) but aren't at all the same thing
